<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to auction 3.3 bln pesos of Cetes.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to auction 3.3 bln pesos of Cetes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said Friday it would auction 3.3 billion pesos worth of Cetes at the primary auction on November 26.</p>
<p>    Terms	  Amount	   Fixed rates:</p>
<p>    28  days     900 million pesos  29.17 pct</p>
<p>    91  days     900 million pesos  27.42 pct</p>
<p>    182 days     900 million pesos  24.37 pct</p>
<p>    343 days     600 million pesos  21.27 pct</p>
<p>The central bank said it will also offer 700 million pesos worth of 728-day Bondes and 250 million UDIs in 1,092-day UDI bonds.</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom 525 7289559</p>
</text>
